{"speciesId":597,"names":{"fr":"Grindur","es":"Ferroseed","en":"Ferroseed","ja":"テッシード"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand il sent un danger, il réagit en projetant toutes ses épines d’un coup et s’enfuit en roulant sur lui-même."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When threatened, it attacks by shooting a barrage of spikes, which gives it a chance to escape by rolling away."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il s’accroche aux parois des grottes à l’aide de ses épines et absorbe les minéraux contenus dans la roche."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They stick their spikes into cave walls and absorb the minerals they find in the rock."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It absorbs the iron it finds in the rock while clinging to the ceiling. It shoots spikes when in danger."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It absorbs the iron it finds in the rock while clinging to the ceiling. It shoots spikes when in danger."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Quand il sent un danger, il réagit en projetant toutes ses épines d’un coup et s’enfuit en roulant sur lui-même."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Lanza numerosas púas al detectar peligro. En cuanto tiene ocasión, echa a rodar y se escapa."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When threatened, it attacks by shooting a barrage of spikes, which gives it a chance to escape by rolling away."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"危険を 察知すると トゲを いっせいに 発射して 反撃。 その すきに 転がって 逃げる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il s’accroche aux parois des grottes et en absorbe les minéraux. Il projette ses épines en cas de danger."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Absorbe los componentes ferruginosos de las rocas al colgarse del techo de las cuevas. Dispara púas si se ve en peligro."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It absorbs the iron it finds in the rock while clinging to the ceiling. It shoots spikes when in danger."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"洞穴の 天井に 突きささり 岩の 鉄分を 吸いとる。 危険がせまると トゲを 撃ち出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Quand il sent un danger, il réagit en projetant toutes ses épines d’un coup et s’enfuit en roulant sur lui-même."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lanza numerosas púas al detectar peligro. En cuanto tiene ocasión, echa a rodar y se escapa."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When threatened, it attacks by shooting a barrage of spikes, which gives it a chance to escape by rolling away."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"危険を 察知すると トゲを いっせいに 発射して 反撃。 その すきに 転がって 逃げる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il s’accroche aux parois des grottes et en absorbe les minéraux. Il projette ses épines en cas de danger."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Absorbe los componentes ferruginosos de las rocas al colgarse del techo de las cuevas. Dispara púas si se ve en peligro."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It absorbs the iron it finds in the rock while clinging to the ceiling. It shoots spikes when in danger."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"洞穴の 天井に 突きささり 岩の 鉄分を 吸いとる。 危険がせまると トゲを 撃ち出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il se protège en projetant ses épines, mais il lui faut beaucoup d’entraînement pour réussir à tirer dans une direction précise."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se defiende lanzando púas, pero para poder apuntar con precisión a su objetivo necesita ingentes sesiones de práctica."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It defends itself by launching spikes, but its aim isn’t very good at first. Only after a lot of practice will it improve."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"棘を 飛ばして 身を 守る。 狙った 方向に 飛ばすには たくさんの 訓練が 必要。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il aime les grottes pleines de mousse. Les enzymes contenues dans ces plantes l’aident à obtenir des épines grandes et solides."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Prefiere las cuevas de paredes musgosas, ya que las enzimas contenidas en el musgo le permiten desarrollar unas púas grandes y robustas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Mossy caves are their preferred dwellings. Enzymes contained in mosses help Ferroseed’s spikes grow big and strong."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"苔むした 洞窟を 好む。 苔が 含む 酵素が 棘を 大きく 丈夫に 育むのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":597,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"pin-missile","learns":[[11,"level-up",18],[14,"level-up",18],[15,"level-up",18],[16,"level-up",18],[17,"level-up",18],[18,"level-up",18],[20,"level-up",10],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leech-seed","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"harden","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"self-destruct","learns":[[11,"level-up",38],[14,"level-up",38],[15,"level-up",38],[16,"level-up",38],[17,"level-up",38],[18,"level-up",38],[20,"level-up",30],[20,"machi